          "comment": "[Playbook] We cannot accept a post-termination non-compete of undefined length binding Ono and its Affiliates, so we have deleted the post-termination extension and confined Ono's Section 8.2 covenant to the term of the Agreement, capped at twelve (12) months, with carve-outs for our internal development and acquired products or programs. Array's side of the exclusivity is untouched; this reflects our fallback position on non-compete restrictions.",
