              "newText": "Ono's and its Affiliates' obligations under this Section 8.2 shall apply only during the term of this Agreement and shall in no event extend beyond the twelve (12) month anniversary of the Effective Date, and shall not restrict (i) Ono's or its Affiliates' internal research or Development activities or (ii) any product or program acquired by Ono or its Affiliates through any acquisition of or merger with a Third Party."
